  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4607.07 CO2 Allowance Tracking System Responsibilities of CO2 AAR",
  "priorExpiration": "2009-03-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4607.07 CO2 Allowance Tracking System Responsibilities of CO2 AAR. Following the establishment of a CO2 allowance tracking system account, all submissions to the regional organization pertaining to the account, including, but not limited to, submissions concerning the deduction or transfer of CO2 allowances in the account, shall be made only by the CO2 AAR for the account.\n\nSource. #9283, INTERIM, eff 10-1-08, EXPIRED: 3-30-09\n\nNew. #9444, eff 4-3-09; ss by #10468, eff 1-1-14; ss by #12967, eff 1-1-20",
